WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
<b>Su-chan 
\h\h\h\h\h\hI Love You</b>

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.190
Here, Su-chan, open wide.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.230
"Ah..."

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:14.180
So Su-chan, it's not just the 
food that I want you to eat.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:20.110
What I want you to eat 
even more... is... me.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.430
Su-chan, let's do...

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:26.620
pervy things.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.780
I was actually expecting that, Tetsuhiko!

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:33.000
<i>You're gross, man.</i>

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.860
Shut up! I just got hit by 
the harshness of reality!

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.940
Su-chan? Are you okay?

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.760
I-I'm fine!

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.300
I'll be right back!

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.710
You've been through this before, 
haven't you? Give me some advice.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:50.720
<i>I'll settle your affairs. 
Go on and have a blast.</i>

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.140
Wha... Hey!

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.200
I-I'm opening it now!

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.860
Haru, you were in there a while.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.300
Does your stomach hurt? 
Need to see a doctor?

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.840
I bet <i>someone</i> fed you something 
that wasn't good for you.

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:03.750
What?

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:25.850
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:42.150
Answering service again?

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:44.430
Yeah. I guess Mom's at work.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.290
That's too bad.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.830
But if you can't get your 
parents' permission,

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.900
I guess you can't stay overnight tonight.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.430
So long, Kuroha-san.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:54.940
Momo, why are you here, anyway?

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.570
I heard you were in danger.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:05.160
Look, I'd appreciate it if you three would 
try to get along a little better.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.400
Who's that?

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:09.810
Yes! Maru here!

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.990
Whoa, whoa! This is <i>my</i> house!

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.820
That's why I said "Maru."

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:16.190
But why are you calling yourself a Maru?!

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:21.880
As your future wife, I thought 
I should get used to saying it now.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.790
Do you even realize what you just said?!

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:27.910
Sueharu! I can hear all 
the voices in there!

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.520
Midori?!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:30.410
Is that twisted woman here again?!

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.520
Don't ring the bell over 
and over at this hour!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.470
You're gonna upset the neighbors!

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:34.860
So, what do you want?

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.730
Hmph! Sorry to interrupt the fun.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:41.680
I'm not allowed to come over without a purpose?
 How full of yourself can you be?

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.480
Don't get mad right off the bat.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:45.820
I never said you couldn't come over.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.430
We brought some clothes and study 
materials for you, Kuro-neesan.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:50.160
Thanks a lot.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:53.380
Hey, Aoi-chan, did you 
have fun on our trip?

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:57.550
Since I got hurt at the end, I didn't 
get to hear your thoughts on it.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.700
You're quite the ladies' man, aren't you?

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.050
It's Kuro-neesan you should 
be talking to, not me.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.940
U-Uh... Aoi-chan?

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.940
Wait, why?

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.110
Aoi-chan... And Akane, you're here, too?

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.900
A-Ah... Haru-nii...

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.050
Akane?

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:22.220
I'm sorry, Haru-nii. 
Something's wrong with me.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:22.830
I'm going home.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.070
I'm going, too!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.240
Midori, did I do something wrong?

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:35.170
They're probably sick of you because 
you keep fawning over so many girls.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.550
They aren't as used to you as I am.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:41.240
They probably think you're filthy and 
don't want to talk to such a pervert.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:42.770
Serves you right!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.270
See ya!

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:48.100
Don't laugh at someone else's misfortune!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:50.600
Huh?

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.990
I'm a teenager now, too, you know.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:56.400
When a boy grabs my hand like that, 
of course I'm gonna freak out.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.900
Oh, come on. You, a teenager?

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.070
Seriously, just...

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.510
Die!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:05.830
Hmph!

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:11.440
That one was all your fault.

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.820
Ow...

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:17.450
But I love that part of you, too.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:20.370
Ow!

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:28.330
I never said my "I love you" game was over.

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:34.000
Oh, Mom? Listen, I...

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.920
What? I can't?

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.860
Okay.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.470
Mom said I can't stay over.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:44.810
O-Oh...

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:46.290
But why?

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.820
I explained everything in 
the letter I left for you!

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:57.450
I'm going home for today,

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.080
but don't you dare cheat 
on me, Sueharu-oniichan.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.810
Uh, you can't call it cheating 
if we're not going out.

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:06.630
It's already set in stone that we're 
getting married, so no other—

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:10.250
Okay, okay. We get your point, 
so you can go home now.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.070
Yeah. You're embarrassing yourself.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:13.020
Wait!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.210
Goodnight.

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:18.830
Sueharu-oniichan! 
Cheating is a crime, you hear?!

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.670
Shida-san, do you have a moment?

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.620
Su-chan, could you head back inside first?

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:25.740
S-Sure...

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:31.060
Maru-san...

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:34.640
You're, uh... the maid who 
came here with Shiro.

00:06:34.640 --> 00:06:36.340
Ohragi-san, was it?

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:36.870
What is it?

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.200
Could you try not to get 
so full of yourself?

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:40.710
Huh?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.920
Shiro-chan told me not to butt in, 
but I can't bear it any longer!

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:48.420
U-Uh... Shiro told you? 
What does that mean?

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:53.570
I see absolutely no reason to 
tell you, you philanderer!

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:57.930
Wait, how can I be a philanderer when this 
whole thing is making my stomach hurt?!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.640
What's this now? Are you trying to 
convince me you're not a lady-killer?

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:04.320
Of course, to be precise,

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:08.140
it seems as though you're not so much a 
lady-killer as a toy for all of them.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.700
Giggle, giggle.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:13.870
Personally, I just find it 
absolutely unsightly. Hmph!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:17.330
<b>Idiot</b>

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:17.330
<i>Damn. This girl might be a lot 
dumber than I had imagined.</i>

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:21.620
Oh? What's that look on your face?
 Are you actually angry?

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.830
I was just thinking you seem like an idiot.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.100
Giggle, giggle.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:26.720
In that case, to finish this,

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:30.590
I, the genius, will tell you 
exactly where you're mistaken.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.850
<i>Oh, she's a genius? Okay, sure.</i>

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:36.850
<b>Genius</b>

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.840
Okay, fine. Where am I mistaken?

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:40.620
In thinking that Shiro-chan likes you.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.050
Th-That's...

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:45.320
What Shiro-chan feels 
toward you is respect.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:49.600
I'm saying that I don't want you to 
misunderstand that. Do you get it?

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:54.530
<b>Mistaken</b>

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:54.230
<i>I mean, I did think that 
might be the case, but...</i>

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:54.220
Giggle, giggle, giggle...

00:07:54.700 --> 00:08:00.550
Really, I can't fathom why Shida-san and 
Momosaka-san give you the time of day, either.

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.500
What's wrong?

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:07.020
Nothing at all.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.880
More importantly, the bath 
should be ready now.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.340
Why don't you go ahead?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.410
Good idea.

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.820
Oh, but since it's Su-chan's house, 
he should take the first bath.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:19.350
Wait here. I'll change into 
something that can get wet.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:25.880
Su-chan can't use his arm, so I was 
going to wash his back for him.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:26.470
Is that a problem?

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:27.980
No problem at all!

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:27.980
Yes, it is!

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.980
<i>Shida-san, do you have a moment?</i>

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:39.990
You seem to think living next door 
to Su-chan gives you an advantage,

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:45.080
but unfortunately for you, 
I'll get to be even closer to him.

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:48.140
<i>This hurts.</i>

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:51.770
<i>In a way, it's worse than 
when I rejected him.</i>

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:55.200
<i>Stupid Haru.</i>

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:59.670
<i>I want you to confess to me. 
Don't give up after just once.</i>

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:10.210
Oh, right.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.360
I can't lose this way.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:18.120
<b>Celebrate! Momosaka Maria-chan's First Day at Our School</b>

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:19.210
Wow! Maria-chan's wearing our uniform!

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.060
But why is she with Maru's group?!

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.860
Aren't you watching the 
Ultramarine Channel?

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:25.080
Maria-chan joined them last week!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.530
Guilty!

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:30.130
Siblings with no blood relation are guilty!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.320
Relax, Goudo! It's fine!

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:35.200
Maru's an idiot, so he sees 
her as a real little sister!

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:36.310
Thank goodness he's an idiot!

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:38.270
I'm Momosaka Maria.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:42.390
I look forward to being here with 
all of you starting today.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:49.140
Ohragi-san goes to our school?

00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.350
Sueharu-oniichan!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:54.000
Let's eat lunch in the cafeteria together!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.230
I'll feed you myself!

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:58.000
I-I'll eat by myself.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:01.200
The atmosphere in this room is 
scaring me! Especially the guys!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.440
Maru-kun, got a second?

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:04.670
Guilty!

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:05.600
Come play with us.

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:05.820
Come on, come on!

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:06.580
Ow!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.770
Stop.

00:10:08.760 --> 00:10:11.350
If you try to do anything to him,

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:15.080
I'll punish you in a manner befitting 
your barbaric behavior.

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:18.060
W-We're sorry!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.950
If you care about Su-chan,

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.170
could you avoid causing such commotions?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.400
You're right. I'll do as you say for today.

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:30.800
You can go back to your own classroom now.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:34.430
I've already prepared 
Su-chan's lunch for him.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:39.420
Su-chan, open wide.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:42.190
Hang on, Shiro. I don't 
think you should...

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.990
O-Okay, then.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:50.020
That's good!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.220
I'm so glad. Here, have another.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:54.200
Really?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.310
Here, Su-chan. Have some rice, too.

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:59.320
Uh, I can eat the rice myself.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.600
This is my apology for getting you hurt.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.880
Don't be shy, now. Open wide.

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.440
Don't misunderstand.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:15.050
Sorry... I'm gonna go wash my face.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.340
Su-chan?

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.290
I can't get the wrong idea.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.330
Haru?

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.490
Are you okay?

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.260
Kuro...

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:35.170
Listen... I couldn't ask this morning 
since everyone was around, but...

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:38.730
I really believe everything's 
probably fine,

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:41.880
and based on your reactions, 
I don't think anything happened,

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.830
but I still want to make sure...

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:48.090
You're not acting like yourself, Kuro.
 What is it you want to ask?

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:52.990
Nothing... happened last night, did it?

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:56.050
Huh? Wh-What are you 
worried about, exactly?

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.500
Well, you know...

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.030
O-Of course nothing happened!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.400
R-Really?

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:04.190
H-Hey... Why don't you trust me?

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:08.070
Because you're a pervert, 
and Kachi-san <i>is</i> pretty.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:10.710
A-Are you crazy?! No way!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.980
Really?

00:12:11.980 --> 00:12:14.330
There wasn't even that kind of mood.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.840
She was super serious about 
helping me study. That's it.

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.330
Is that really all?

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:24.580
Well, also... for some reason, 
we ended up playing Othello all night.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.830
Huh? I don't get it.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.220
Anyway, don't get all worried 
about anything weird.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.300
Actually, you seem pretty sullen today.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:36.890
Dummy. A pervert like you is the last 
person I want to hear that from.

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:41.640
You've been teasing me a lot lately.
 Just paying you back.

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:46.610
So you did think I was teasing you.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.470
Even if you're teasing me,

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:53.620
I love the way you tell 
me you love me, too.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.590
H-Hey... You're copying me!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.070
How dare you copy me?!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:02.010
Well, I don't like being on the 
receiving end all the time.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:05.590
Though, you know, you're kinda 
like a warrior in bikini armor.

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:08.050
<b>Submissions from You            Theme: "Bikini Armor"</b>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:08.050
<b>By K-kun</b>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:08.050
<b>By Hiroko-chan</b>

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.960
You dumped too much into attack power.

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:11.310
Wh-What the heck does that mean?!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.230
<b>Kai Tetsuhiko</b>

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.230
New Message

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.230
<b>Meet up in the club room right now.
There's something I want to tell you all ASAP.</b>

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:26.990
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:26.990
<b>\hEpisode 10 
The Girls' Secret Discussion</b>

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:26.990
<b>Let's play
 Othello!</b>

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:26.990
<b>We're playing
 Othello!</b>

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:30.970
The thing is, I heard from 
Souichirou-san yesterday.

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.800
What? My dad?

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:35.150
He said a TV station was asking for us.

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:39.440
They want us to make a 
documentary about the period

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.480
from Sueharu's disappearance 
up to his return on WeTube.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:43.600
Huh?

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:45.830
That sounds like a good project.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:49.650
If I hadn't heard everything 
from Su-chan himself,

00:13:49.650 --> 00:13:52.000
I'd definitely want to watch it.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:55.580
Su-chan's sudden retirement 
really was a shock.

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.580
But wouldn't that be 
ignoring how Haru feels?

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.630
I know.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:04.600
Which is why I'm not gonna move on this 
project unless Sueharu gives the okay.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.720
I'm against it.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:10.090
I know how badly Haru was 
hurt when his mother died,

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:12.350
how lost he was, and how much he suffered.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:16.490
Even if Haru agrees to be the 
star of a blatant tearjerker,

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:17.380
I'm still against it.

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:18.570
Kuro...

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:21.860
I...

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:27.230
I don't want to see any program 
made that ignores the truth.

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:30.550
But there's a high risk of 
it turning out that way.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.100
TV networks are businesses, so their 
priority is to make a profit.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:38.110
Do you ever feel like you 
want to get closure?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.580
Closure?

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.460
If it's released as a video,

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:46.510
the weekly magazines will probably 
start coming after you,

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:49.640
and people who knew you in the 
past might start talking.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.970
If it's all gonna come out anyway, 
shouldn't you try to get closure

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:56.570
in a way that you can agree with?

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:03.550
But if they decide to make a TV show, 
we won't be able to do anything, right?

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:06.090
And if they ignore Haru's 
wishes and air it...

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.470
Which is why...

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:11.670
I was up all night coming up with 
a counter-plan to prevent that.

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:15.140
First, as for Sueharu's documentary,

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.590
we will produce it ourselves as 
an Ultramarine Alliance project.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:25.940
Sueharu Documentary 
True Ending

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:21.780
Of course, that'll bring the quality down,

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:25.930
but we'll be able to make it in a 
way that Sueharu agrees with 100%.

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:30.060
Oh, yeah. Then it wouldn't just 
be a blatant tearjerker.

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.540
What is this "true ending" thing, then?

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:37.400
The true ending of <i>Child King</i>.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:39.760
<i>Child King</i>... Isn't that...

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:42.600
It was Sueharu-oniichan's last acting role.

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:45.930
As a continuation of the social 
phenomenon <i>Child Star</i>,

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.370
it also became a hot topic.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:55.230
It's also the memorable series in which 
Sueharu-oniichan and I first acted together.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:58.060
<b>Explained Through Manga</b>

00:15:55.300 --> 00:16:00.060
<b>Child King</b>

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:03.070
<i>Despite being poor, our protagonist, Ren, 
lives happily with his beloved mother.</i>

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:07.000
<i>But then, one day, he loses 
his mother in an accident</i>

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.790
<i>and is left without a 
single living relative.</i>

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.500
<i>But it turned out her accident was planned.</i>

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:16.970
<i>Upon learning this terrifying truth,
 Ren swears revenge.</i>

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.750
Do you want to be a king?

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:23.500
Of course I'm worried. 
We've been friends forever.

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:26.320
You okay?

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.720
Thank you so much.

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:29.960
I win.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:32.430
I'm not gonna lose again!

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:36.270
After a vicious battle, 
Ren achieves his revenge,

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:39.630
but a tragic fate awaits him!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:41.970
I miss them...

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:49.660
I wish I could see them... 
just one more time.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.570
<b>"Then six years later, 
\h\h\hthe story sees its emotional finale"</b>

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.780
<b>"Then six years later, 
\h\h\hthe story sees its emotional finale"</b>

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:57.730
A different actor did the 
"six years later" ending scene, right?

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:01.610
Obviously. I was only 11 at the time.

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:04.020
There's no way I could've played a 17-year-old.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.640
And now, you're...

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:06.710
I'm... 17.

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:13.850
The real 17-year-old Maru Sueharu will 
act out the ending scene of <i>Child King</i>.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:17.460
In other words, we'll film 
the true ending ourselves.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:21.400
I see. That would definitely 
generate buzz.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.250
The TV network might be 
eager to jump on it, too.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:24.940
Yeah.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:25.900
Which means...

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:29.510
We politely decline the 
TV network's proposal,

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:31.500
and in return for making it ourselves,

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:36.270
we propose our true ending and 
convince them to compromise.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.640
I don't want to force this on you.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:43.440
I'm just saying you might be 
okay with doing it this way,

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:46.780
and it could be an efficient way 
to make some profit and fame.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.420
So you decide.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.410
Thanks, Tetsuhiko.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.920
Anyway, you can give me 
your answer on Saturday.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.170
You need to focus on the exams 
starting tomorrow first.

00:17:59.060 --> 00:17:59.790
Yeah.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:42.700
<b>"Good kids, don't try
\h this at home♥ "</b>

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.450
That's so good.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:43.140
Ahem!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:48.120
Now, why don't you tell us why you 
asked us both to meet you here?

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:50.380
Okay, I'll tell you.

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:52.950
I think we stand out too much at school.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:57.360
Does the one who sniffs 
Su-chan in the classroom

00:19:57.360 --> 00:20:00.530
and tells everyone she's 
dating him get to say that?

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:03.190
You were so obvious right before 
the confession festival

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:05.050
that it embarrassed me just to watch.

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:07.180
She did all that?

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.800
Let me just say, I'm impressed.

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:10.690
What about you?

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:14.680
You come to Haru's class during 
every break and hang all over him.

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:16.950
It's embarrassing just to watch you.

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:18.400
And you, Kachi-san!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.330
Me?

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:21.020
What was that all about today?

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.320
When you fed him!

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:26.560
I got him hurt. I owe him 
that degree of service.

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:28.940
You think that's an excuse to go <i>that</i> far?

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:33.540
Again, do you get to say that after 
what you did to him in the library?

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:37.030
I guess the cat's out of the bag, huh?

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:38.520
You said it.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:43.480
Actually, I was thinking we need 
to impose a certain limitation.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.160
What's that?

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.920
We know Sueharu-oniichan is a pervert, yes?

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:51.060
I feel like if Kuroha-san got over him,

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:54.900
she'd use her feminine wiles 
to create a fait accompli.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.900
Frankly, that's what scares 
me more than anything.

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:01.150
I'm only a girl! A young maiden!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.790
There's no way I could do that!

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:05.790
I won't deny that you're a young maiden,

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:10.860
but I also feel like you need a second title,

00:21:10.860 --> 00:21:13.120
like Devilish Maiden or Strategic Maiden.

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.340
If you're going that route, Momo-san,

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:17.080
<b>Fuji Safari Park</b>

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.090
aren't you a hyena-type 
little sister figure?

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:21.190
Oh, really? You're going to say 
that about me, Kuroha-san?

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:24.440
I won't just keep quiet and let 
you talk about me that way!

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:27.080
You haven't kept quiet this whole time.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:29.450
You're the one who started this, remember?

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.140
Honestly, the two of you are an eyesore.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.870
Stay out of this, Clunker.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:38.810
Are you two familiar with the rakugo 
routine "Sanbou Ichiryouzon"?

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.290
"Sanbou Ichiryouzon"?

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:42.840
Yeah, uh...

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:46.150
Isn't that about the plasterer who dropped 
three ryo and the carpenter who found them,

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:49.280
but they're both Edokko, so they 
both say they don't need them?

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:53.020
Yes. Ohka Ichizen added another ryo to it,

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:54.980
so they both got two.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:59.240
So they concluded that everyone 
equally lost one ryo in the deal.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:02.440
In other words, Shirokusa-san thinks 
we should all yield one demand

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:04.830
and accept each other's demands equally.

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:07.800
I guess that's the compromise.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.270
So let me just make sure.

00:22:10.270 --> 00:22:13.220
First, Shida-san, you'll stop 
your "I love you" game.

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:16.500
I had no idea Momo-san knew about that.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:18.250
Shida-san, your answer?

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:20.360
Okay. For now.

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:22.530
Hey! That's not allowed!

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:23.220
Tch.

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:25.520
Honestly, this girl...

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:28.990
I'd like to lecture her for about ten 
hours and wring her out like a washrag.

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:33.570
Momosaka-san, you are forbidden to do 
anything thoughtless that will cause a commotion.

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:36.080
All right, I suppose.

00:22:36.390 --> 00:22:41.280
Finally, I'll agree to the three of us 
taking care of Su-chan in rotation.

00:22:41.280 --> 00:22:45.500
The only condition is that Shion 
will be present as a chaperone.

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:46.290
Understood?

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:48.890
Got it.

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:52.970
Oh... Is it all right if I change 
the subject for a moment?

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:55.860
It's about the documentary.

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:58.190
I thought we agreed that was up to Su-chan.

00:22:58.190 --> 00:23:01.550
Of course it is, but I had an idea,

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:04.620
so I was hoping to get 
both of you to agree.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.270
I see. If that's what you're thinking...

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:15.620
I have no objections, either.

00:23:16.070 --> 00:23:19.890
<i>I never expected my chance to 
drop into my lap like this!</i>

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:21.820
<i>Now I can count on actually winning!</i>

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:24.460
<i>This is a huge chance.</i>

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:28.390
<i>Su-chan might finally remember 
what happened that day.</i>

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:30.800
<i>And if he does, I'm sure...</i>

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:33.810
<i>They both fell for it hook, line, and sinker!</i>

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:37.010
<i>I feel bad for the others, 
but I've won this one!</i>
